WEBVTT

01:39:59.911 --> 01:40:05.041
- Hagrid, what exactly is that?
- That? It's...

01:40:05.249 --> 01:40:07.251
I know what that is!

01:40:07.502 --> 01:40:10.129
But, Hagrid, how did you get one?

01:40:10.505 --> 01:40:13.758
I won it. Off a stranger
I met down at the pub.

01:40:13.925 --> 01:40:18.054
Seemed quite glad to be rid of it,
as a matter of fact.

01:40:43.287 --> 01:40:44.455
A dragon?

01:40:44.664 --> 01:40:49.085
That's not just a dragon.
That's a Norwegian ridgeback.

01:40:49.293 --> 01:40:52.171
My brother works
with these in Romania.

01:40:52.380 --> 01:40:57.260
Isn't he beautiful? Oh, bless him.
Look, he knows his mummy.

01:40:57.927 --> 01:40:59.679
Hello, norbert.

01:40:59.971 --> 01:41:04.308
- Norbert?
- He's gotta have a name, don't he?

01:41:05.059 --> 01:41:07.478
Don't you, norbert?

01:41:14.485 --> 01:41:17.613
He'll have to be trained up a bit,
of course.

01:41:21.492 --> 01:41:23.578
Who's that?

01:41:25.288 --> 01:41:27.331
Malfoy.

01:41:28.124 --> 01:41:29.500
Oh, dear.

01:41:31.252 --> 01:41:36.007
Harry: Hagrid always wanted a dragon.
Told me so the first time I met him.

01:41:36.257 --> 01:41:40.303
Ron: It's crazy.
And worse, Malfoy knows.

01:41:40.511 --> 01:41:44.599
- Harry: I don't understand. Is that bad?
- It's bad.

01:41:44.849 --> 01:41:47.018
Good evening.

01:41:50.688 --> 01:41:53.608
Nothing, I repeat, nothing...

01:41:53.858 --> 01:41:57.361
Gives a student the right
to walk about at night.

01:41:57.528 --> 01:42:02.450
Therefore, as punishment for your
actions, 50 points will be taken.

01:42:06.037 --> 01:42:08.372
To ensure it doesn't happen again...

01:42:08.623 --> 01:42:11.959
All four of you
will receive detention.

01:42:12.877 --> 01:42:15.838
Excuse me, professor,
perhaps I heard you wrong.

01:42:16.047 --> 01:42:18.382
I thought you said the four of us.

01:42:18.549 --> 01:42:21.052
No, you heard me correctly.

01:42:21.302 --> 01:42:26.307
Honorable as your intentions were,
you too were out of bed after hours.

01:42:26.766 --> 01:42:29.727
You will join your classmates
in detention.

01:42:40.905 --> 01:42:44.909
Filch: A pity they let
the old punishments die.

01:42:45.159 --> 01:42:49.872
Was a time detention found you
hanging by your thumbs in the dungeons.

01:42:50.081 --> 01:42:52.917
God, I miss the screaming.

01:42:55.419 --> 01:42:58.756
You'll be serving detention
with Hagrid tonight.
